# Builder's Talent: "When this Class enters, create a 0/4 white Wall creature token with defender." The Talent is a level 1
# Class (CR 716.2a): its "whenever one or more noncreature, nonland permanents you control enter" ability exists only from
# level 2, so Bot1's Mox Emerald entering at level 1 puts no counter on the Wall.

